Package: majoris-characters
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Native character utility for Majoris
 Provides a native GTK application foundation and internal Unicode engine
 for names, properties, blocks, scripts, emoji, and related characters.
 Interactive character browsing is planned for a subsequent release.
